utation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1003005","helmet":"WP1023105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10115","name":{"zh":"征讨南蛮","en":"Southern Campaign"},"year":"225","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1038","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[67,60,63,81,67,70],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1003005","helmet":"WP1023105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10915","name":{"zh":"北伐中原","en":"Northern Expedition"},"year":"227","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1038","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[67,60,63,81,67,70],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1003005","helmet":"WP1023105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1038","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[67,60,63,81,67,70],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1003005","helmet":"WP1023105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1038","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[67,60,63,81,67,70],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1003005","helmet":"WP1023105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1038","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[67,60,63,81,67,70],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1003005","helmet":"WP1023105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1023","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[67,60,63,81,67,70],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"99","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1003005","helmet":"WP1023105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1038","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[67,60,63,81,67,70],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1003005","helmet":"WP1023105"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"魏国武将。以典农中郎将身份主持许昌屯田，招募流民开垦荒地，采用分田之术按比例征收租税，数年间所在积粟，仓廪皆满，仅许昌一地即获粮百万斛。此制度迅速推广至各郡国，形成中央到地方的屯田管理体系，为曹魏提供了稳定的经济来源，为统一北方奠定了坚实的经济基础。官渡之战时负责运粮部队，抵御了袁绍的进攻。曹操对任峻极为倚重，每次出征均令其留守后方。任峻去世时，曹操流涕者久之。","tc":"魏國武將。以典農中郎將身份主持許昌屯田，招募流民開墾荒地，采用 分田之術 按比例征收租稅，數年間 所在積粟，倉廩皆滿，僅許昌一地即獲糧百萬斛。此制度迅速推廣至各郡國，形成中央到地方的屯田管理體系，為曹魏提供了穩定的經濟來源，為統一北方奠定了堅實的經濟基礎。官渡之戰時負責運糧部隊，抵御了袁紹的進攻。曹操對任峻極為倚重，每次出征均令其留守后方。任峻去世時，曹操流涕者久之。","en":"An officer of Wei. As Chief Agricultural Officer, he oversaw the agricultural colonies at Xuchang, recruiting displaced people to cultivate wasteland and implementing a proportional tax system. Within a few years, the granaries in his jurisdiction were overflowing, with Xuchang alone yielding a million hu of grain. This system was rapidly expanded to all commanderies, creating a centralized agricultural administration from the capital to the provinces. It provided Cao Wei with a stable source of revenue and laid a solid economic foundation for unifying the north. During the Battle of Guandu, he was responsible for the supply convoys and successfully defended them against Yuan Shao's attacks. Cao Cao relied heavily on Ren Jun, entrusting him with defending the rear whenever he went on campaign. When Ren Jun died, Cao Cao wept for a long time.","jp":"魏の武将。典農中郎将として許昌での屯田を主導し、流民を募って荒地を開墾させた。「分田の術」を取り入れて定率で租税を徴収したことで、数年のうちに各地の倉は穀物で満たされ、許昌一帯だけでも百万斛の兵糧を得た。この制度は速やかに各郡国へと普及して中央から地方に至る屯田管理体制が確立され、曹魏に安定した経済的収入をもたらし、北方統一のための強固な経済基盤を築き上げた。官渡の戦いでは兵糧輸送部隊を率いて袁紹軍の攻撃を防ぎ切った。曹操から絶大な信頼を寄せられ、出陣のたびに後方の留守を任されていた。任峻が死去した際、曹操は久しく涙を流してその死を悼んだ。","kr":"위나라의 무장. 전농중랑장의 신분으로 허창의 둔전을 총괄하며 유민을 모아 황무지를 개간하고, 분전지술(分田之術)을 적용해 비율에 따라 조세를 징수하였다. 수년 만에 곳곳에 곡식이 쌓이고 창고가 가득 찼으며, 허창 한 곳에서 거둔 군량만 해도 백만 곡에 달했다. 이 제도는 각 군국으로 빠르게 보급되어 중앙에서 지방에 이르는 둔전 관리 체계를 구축하였고, 조위에 안정적인 경제적 원천을 제공하여 북방 통일의 견고한 경제적 기반을 마련하였다. 관도대전 때는 군량 수송 부대를 통솔해 원소군의 공격을 막아냈다. 조조는 임준을 몹시 신임하여 매번 출진할 때마다 후방을 지키도록 맡겼으며, 임준이 세상을 떠나자 오랫동안 눈물을 흘렸다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10585","remark":"","surname":"任","surnameTc":"任","surnameEn":"Ren","surnameJp":"任","surnameKr":"임","surnameOther":"","name":"峻","nameTc":"峻","nameEn":"Jun","nameJp":"峻","nameKr":"준","nameOther":"","word":"伯达","wordTc":"伯達","wordEn":"Boda","wordJp":"伯達","wordKr":"백달","wordOther":"","icon":"任峻","power":"WJ10001","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"189","city":"CS1023","gender":"0","rule":"67","force":"60","wise":"63","politics":"81","charm":"67","will":"70","ruleTalent":"7","forceTalent":"6","wiseTalent":"5","politicsTalent":"9","charmTalent":"6","willTalent":"6","weaponMaster":"26/26/60/26/26/18/50/26","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"4400","battleSoulPoint":"3600","debateSoulPoint":"3900","strategy":"1000908","strategy2":"","professions":"0/0/1/1/0/0/1/1/5/1/2/1/1/0/2/0/0/0/0/3/0/0/0/1","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"5","compatible":"14","loyalty":"99","reputation":"0","evaluate":"0","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"165","show":"189","death":"204","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"0","type":"1","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"0","weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1003005","helmet":"WP10231